  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>This series is a G.P. with first term&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>49</mn><mn>125</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and common ratio&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>49</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p>So, its sum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>49</mn></mfenced><mn>126</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>48</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>49</mn></mfenced><mn>63</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>49</mn><mn>63</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>48</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
